tion process and meeting dates", "header_size": "h1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=white"}, "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 56, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_size_mobile": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "_css_classes": "g-ph1"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a09c2f9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p>How the Conditioned Air Board currently processes applications, and when it meets.</p>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=lead", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=line"}, "_css_classes": "g-plead"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "1fb2e9b", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "40", "row": "40", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 40}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "104", "right": "64", "bottom": "104", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1312, "sizes": []}, "flex_gap_mobile": {"column": "28", "row": "28", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 28}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "40", "bottom": "80", "left": "40", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "64", "right": "20", "bottom": "64", "left": "20", "isLinked": false}, "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "dc94ca3", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "64", "row": "64", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 64}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap_mobile": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 32}, "css_classes": "g-twocol g-twocol--even"}, "elements": [{"id": "37dcbce", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "16", "row": "16", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 16}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "e3d0c93", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "Continuous testing, year-round", "header_size": "h2", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=navy", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=h2"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f7918b9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p>On 10-17-2022 the Georgia Construction Industry Licensing Board (CILB) and PSI-Exams announced that continuous testing is available, which greatly reduces the time for exam-approved applicants to get an exam appointment.</p><ul class=\"g-list\"><li>The Board sends PSI a list of applicants approved to sit for an exam, and PSI imports it into its system.</li><li>PSI then emails each candidate a confirmation and instructions for scheduling an exam appointment.</li><li>Allow 7 to 10 business days from notice of the Board&rsquo;s approval to receive the email from PSI.</li><li>Questions: call <a href=\"tel:+14044249966\">404-424-9966</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:Trades4@sos.ga.gov\">Trades4@sos.ga.gov</a> (Georgia Secretary of State, CILB / PLB).</li></ul>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=body", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=ink"}, "_css_classes": "g-prose "}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d302d2b", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "16", "row": "16", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 16}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "3652c33", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "How applications are processed", "header_size": "h2", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=navy", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=h2"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "81c496f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p class=\"g-muted-note\">Application processes have changed and may continue to change, but this is basically the current process, as we understand it.</p>", "__globals__": {}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a76a9eb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<ul class=\"g-list\"><li>There are no application deadline dates any more.</li><li>Board staff typically take a couple of weeks to review applications and make sure they are 100% complete, with no deficiencies.</li><li>Staff then tell the Board members which applications are ready for approval. The Board does not always wait for a Board meeting.</li><li>For questionable applications, the Board may wait for the next meeting to decide on approval or denial together.</li><li>Some applications need more detailed review. The Board may email you describing your deficiencies, or on rarer occasions ask for a Zoom meeting or for you to appear at the next Board meeting.</li></ul>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=body", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=ink"}, "_css_classes": "g-prose "}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "3c71567", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "40", "row": "40", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 40}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "72", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1312, "sizes": []}, "flex_gap_mobile": {"column": "28", "row": "28", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 28}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "40", "bottom": "80", "left": "40", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "64", "right": "20", "bottom": "64", "left": "20", "isLinked": false}, "background_background": "classic", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=mist"}, "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "3ab2f02", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "flex_gap": {"column": "40", "row": "40", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 40}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "css_classes": "g-band", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_justify_content": "space-between", "flex_direction_tablet": "column"}, "elements": [{"id": "bede34c", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "10", "row": "10", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 10}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "dbb504f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "Board meeting dates for 2026", "header_size": "h2", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=navy", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=h2"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "cc7fc15", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p>All Board meeting dates are on a Wednesday. Dates are subject to change.</p>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=body", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=slate"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "4a4de9e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "isInner": false, "settings": {"html": "<ul class=\"g-dates\"><li><b>Feb 4</b><span>February</span></li><li><b>Apr 29</b><span>April</span></li><li><b>Jul 22</b><span>July</span></li><li><b>Sep 21</b><span>September</span></li><li><b>Oct 21</b><span>October</span></li></ul>"}, "elements": []}]}]}], "page_settings": {"hid